+| Selection | Behavior |
+|---|---|
+| `most_frequent` (canonical default) | Select each section's unique most frequent nonzero color. |
+| `least_frequent` | Select each section's unique least frequent nonzero color. |
 
-| Parameter | Value | Executed behavior |
-|---|---|---|
-| `selection` | `most_frequent` **(original/default)** | Select the unique most frequent nonzero color present in each section. |
-| `selection` | `least_frequent` | Select the unique least frequent nonzero color present in each section. |
+`programs/most_frequent.rkt` remains byte-identical to the canonical program.
